put these things?"

00:04:30.434 --> 00:04:31.567
[ Laughter ]

00:04:31.567 --> 00:04:33.033
[ Pops lips ]

00:04:33.033 --> 00:04:34.968
Oh, my posture is better.

00:04:34.968 --> 00:04:36.834
-No!
-Wow.

00:04:36.834 --> 00:04:39.434
Well, according to a new study,
for the first time in decades,

00:04:39.434 --> 00:04:43.033
IQ scores in the U.S.
have fallen.

00:04:43.033 --> 00:04:44.434
I think that might be true.

00:04:44.434 --> 00:04:46.968
Take a look at this recent
episode of "Jeopardy!" I saw.

00:04:52.200 --> 00:04:53.200
Kris Anne.

00:04:53.200 --> 00:04:54.467
-What is "Free Willy?"
-No.

